usage: runner.py [-h] [--cases CASES] [--lock LOCK] [--contract CONTRACT]
                 [--identity-attestation IDENTITY_ATTESTATION]
                 [--results-dir RESULTS_DIR] [--run-id RUN_ID] [--case CASE]
                 [--category CATEGORY] [--backend {OwnerFs,DFS}]
                 [--meta {etcd,Redis}] [--transport TRANSPORT]
                 [--profile {smoke,full}] [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--list]

AFS Linux ARM64 acceptance runner

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --cases CASES         case manifest JSON
  --lock LOCK           acceptance lock JSON
  --contract CONTRACT   actual acceptance.md to hash against lock.contract
  --identity-attestation IDENTITY_ATTESTATION
                        observed Linux source/binary identity JSON for full
                        release
  --results-dir RESULTS_DIR
                        immutable results root
  --run-id RUN_ID       optional unique run id for tests/repro
  --case CASE           case id to run; repeatable
  --category CATEGORY   case category filter
  --backend {OwnerFs,DFS}
                        matrix backend selection
  --meta {etcd,Redis}   matrix meta backend selection
  --transport TRANSPORT
                        matrix transport selection
  --profile {smoke,full}
  --timeout TIMEOUT     per-driver timeout seconds
  --list                list selected cases without executing
